      {
        "id": "resumes_list",
        "method": "GET",
        "path": "/api/v1/resumes/",
        "description": "List resumes with pagination. Every filter is optional and they combine with AND. A comma separates search terms; a recognised skill in the search box must be on the resume's skill list (Java never matches JavaScript) and every other word must start a word in the name, email, file name, headline, location, role, job title or company. The skill filter takes one skill or several comma separated skills, all of which must match. business_domain is a slug from /filters/options (other means no listed domain) and an unknown slug matches nothing. domain is the job family. Newest first; with a search or skill filter the order is relevance, then years of experience, then newest. limit is capped at 500.",
